1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
[ethereal music]

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,583
1337.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,983
The world belongs to Men.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,483
But the world remembers an older age.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,983
And so do the Elves.

6
00:00:29,883 --> 00:00:34,883
An odd woman arrives at your court…

7
00:00:37,216 --> 00:00:41,216
Fund her expedition.

8
00:00:44,549 --> 00:00:50,049
Unearth the tomb of the Last Elf Emperor.

9
00:00:52,216 --> 00:00:56,216
Touch the amulet.

10
00:01:03,383 --> 00:01:09,383
Become Elves.

11
00:01:11,383 --> 00:01:18,383
Every ruler. Every courtier. Every pop.

12
00:01:18,816 --> 00:01:24,816
The Red Witches speak of
a gateway between worlds.

13
00:01:30,016 --> 00:01:34,016
Restore the Grand Portal.

14
00:01:49,516 --> 00:01:55,016
Build a network of gateways
across the world.

15
00:01:57,516 --> 00:02:02,016
And march your armies…

16
00:02:04,016 --> 00:02:09,016
…anywhere.

17
00:02:09,536 --> 00:02:15,536
Rediscover the lost Elven arts.

18
00:02:22,069 --> 00:02:27,569
Recruit unique elven regiments and levies.

19
00:02:29,236 --> 00:02:34,736
And field the Magi, a brand new unit type.

20
00:02:37,736 --> 00:02:43,736
Ascend through nine tiers of Elvenkind.

21
00:02:55,736 --> 00:03:00,236
From mortal…

22
00:03:01,736 --> 00:03:07,736
…to Elven Demi-God.

23
00:03:08,947 --> 00:03:14,447
Rule beside the immortal Calaquendi.

24
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:26,280
Master your elven government

25
00:03:27,614 --> 00:03:33,614
with 18 new government reforms
and estate privileges to wield.

26
00:03:43,114 --> 00:03:48,614
Receive the blessings
of the Divine Spark.

27
00:03:52,114 --> 00:03:56,614
Collect all five blessings
of the Divine Spark.

28
00:03:57,114 --> 00:04:01,114
Some with... interesting effects.

29
00:04:02,114 --> 00:04:08,114
Breed genetic traits through marriage
to forge perfect heirs.

30
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:16,780
More than 35 genetic traits to encounter.

31
00:04:23,947 --> 00:04:29,947
Seek out the powerful bloodlines
of ancient elven houses.

32
00:04:40,411 --> 00:04:41,511
81 elven realms.

33
00:04:41,611 --> 00:04:42,711
15 new advances.

34
00:04:42,811 --> 00:04:43,911
17 new buildings.

35
00:04:44,011 --> 00:04:45,111
4 new trade goods.

36
00:04:45,211 --> 00:04:46,311
18 reforms & privileges.

37
00:04:46,411 --> 00:04:47,511
5 divine blessings.

38
00:04:47,611 --> 00:04:48,711
39 genetic traits.

39
00:04:48,995 --> 00:04:51,195
A portal network spanning continents.

40
00:04:51,995 --> 00:04:55,295
One destiny.

41
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,000
[music fades out]

42
00:05:07,830 --> 00:05:10,010
["I know it's my Destiny"]

43
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,700
[Gimli: "Never trust an Elf!"]
